type: software
abstract: >
  A Python toolkit for auditing wearable-derived digital biomarkers for
  acquisition artifacts, environmental confounding, reliability failures,
  and fairness disparities. Produces a six-component Digital Biomarker
  Trust Score with a per-participant and per-cohort report.
